WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.185
Before sowing,

2
00:00:01.185 --> 00:00:03.082
the government announces a floor

3
00:00:03.082 --> 00:00:04.651
price for many crops.

4
00:00:04.651 --> 00:00:07.246
That's the Minimum Support Price.

5
00:00:07.577 --> 00:00:09.554
MSP is announced for 22

6
00:00:09.554 --> 00:00:11.274
mandated crops,

7
00:00:11.274 --> 00:00:12.585
and a fair price for

8
00:00:12.585 --> 00:00:14.807
sugarcane is set separately.

9
00:00:15.158 --> 00:00:17.555
The Commission for Agricultural Costs

10
00:00:17.555 --> 00:00:19.494
and Prices recommends it.

11
00:00:19.494 --> 00:00:21.757
The Cabinet Committee on Economic

12
00:00:21.757 --> 00:00:23.369
Affairs decides.

13
00:00:23.712 --> 00:00:24.895
Since 2018–19,

14
00:00:24.895 --> 00:00:26.507
MSP has been set at

15
00:00:26.507 --> 00:00:28.192
least one and a half

16
00:00:28.192 --> 00:00:30.664
times paid-out costs plus family

17
00:00:30.664 --> 00:00:32.872
labour. Farmer groups ask for

18
00:00:32.872 --> 00:00:34.284
a wider cost measure,

19
00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:35.252
C two.

20
00:00:35.922 --> 00:00:37.193
Your turn.

21
00:00:37.193 --> 00:00:39.530
Who recommends MSP?
